  "body": "As per the change in ui events change click event from a MouseEvent to a PointerEvent.\nAs such, HTMLElement.click() has to fire a \"click\" PointerEvent at the target instead of a \"click\" MouseEvent.\nThis PR is completing [Change click and contextmenu event types to PointerEvent #5324](https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/5324) as per https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/5324#issuecomment-721361755.\n\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * Chrome (@NavidZ) / Edge (@BoCupp-Microsoft)\n   * Firefox (@smaug----)\n- [x] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * [Chromium CL](https://crrev.com/c/2520239) which makes HTMLElement.click() fire PointerEvent also changes Web Platform Test uievents/interface/click-event.html\n- [x] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/master/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Chrome: https://crbug.com/989958\n   * Firefox: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1675847\n   * Safari: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=218665\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6126/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 6, 2020, 8:17 PM UTC (2b709ee)\">/acknowledgements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6126/a2d27c6...2b709ee/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 6, 2020, 8:17 PM UTC (2b709ee)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6126/custom-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 6, 2020, 8:17 PM UTC (2b709ee)\">/custom-elements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6126/a2d27c6...2b709ee/custom-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 6, 2020, 8:17 PM UTC (2b709ee)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6126/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 6, 2020, 8:17 PM UTC (2b709ee)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6126/a2d27c6...2b709ee/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 6, 2020, 8:17 PM UTC (2b709ee)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6126/interaction.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 6, 2020, 8:17 PM UTC (2b709ee)\">/interaction.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6126/a2d27c6...2b709ee/interaction.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 6, 2020, 8:17 PM UTC (2b709ee)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6126/webappapis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 6, 2020, 8:17 PM UTC (2b709ee)\">/webappapis.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6126/a2d27c6...2b709ee/webappapis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Nov 6, 2020, 8:17 PM UTC (2b709ee)\">diff</a> )",
